# The managed-workstation release range this repository expects (Issue #57). One range, comparators
# separated by blanks, all of which must hold. Compared with the installed provenance stamp at session
# start (an instruction in the user brief) and by ./mhw status. A mismatch prints one line and
# never blocks. The latest release is v10.0.0 (published 2026-11-07), so this repository expects a 10.x
# install from v10.0 on (the range read >=4.0 <5 until Issue #62, then >=5.4 <6 until 2026-11-08).
>=10.0 <11
